                                "sense_id": "a382ac69-de29-3351-9284-b63ae8c9f507",
                                "text": "Then one night in bed, Simon gently suggested swinging. I was resistant to it, but I thought Simon might leave me if I said no. I agreed to it for him, for our relationship."
